<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-West Indies v Australia XI scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-West Indies v Australia XI scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth and final day of the tour match between West Indies and an Australian XI at Bellerive Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>Australian XI first innings 544 for four declared (Matthew Hayden 224, Matthew Elliot 158)</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 317 (Courtney Browne 93 not out)</p>
<p>West Indies second innings (overnight 102 for two)</p>
<p> S.Campbell c Gilchrist b Stuart	 22</p>
<p> R.Samuels c Bichel b Hogg		 34</p>
<p> S.Chanderpaul c Lehmann b Stuart	77</p>
<p> I.Bishop lbw b Hogg			 15</p>
<p> B.Lara c Bichel b Hogg		    63</p>
<p> C.Hooper lbw b Blewett		    12</p>
<p> R.Holder lbw b Blewett		     0</p>
<p> J.Adams c Gilchrist b Blewett	   13</p>
<p> C.Browne c and Blewett		     1</p>
<p> N.McLean not out			     0</p>
<p> P.Thompson lbw b Blewett		   0</p>
<p> Extras (b-3 lb-3 nb-4)		    14</p>
<p> Total (76.5 overs)			 251</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-42, 2-92, 3-153, 4-153, 5-178, 6-178, 7-244, 8-250, 9-251.</p>
<p>Bowling: Gillespie 9-2-28-0, Bichel 12-2-32-0, Stuart 14-4-43-2, Blewett 13.5-7-29-5 (nb-1), Hogg 21-5-81-3 (nb-3), Lehmann 7-1-32-0.</p>
<p>Note: Australian XI bowled four no balls, each worth two runs</p>
<p>Australian XI second innings</p>
<p> M.Elliot not out			    12</p>
<p> M.Hayden not out			    13</p>
<p> Extras (lb-1 nb-1)			   3</p>
<p> Total (for no wicket, 9.4 overs)	28</p>
<p>Bowling: Bishop 5-2-12-0, McLean 4.4-1-15-0 (nb-1).</p>
<p>Note: West Indies bowled one no ball, worth two runs.</p>
<p>Result: Australian XI won by 10 wickets.</p>
